| Workflow | Purpose | Trigger conditions | Dependencies | Outputs |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `preview.yml` | Validate PR ingest + build path | PR to `main` | Node runtime, npm dependencies, ingest/build scripts | PR build validation result |
